   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 03 - Metode Modern: ResNet-50 Feature Extraction & Cosine Retrieval\n",
    "### Proyek Kelompok Pengolahan Citra Digital (PCD) 2026 · Topik T5\n",
    "**Tahap 2 · Penilaian UAS (Bobot 20%)**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Tujuan Notebook:**\n",
    "1. Memuat arsitektur Deep Learning **ResNet-50** (Pretrained ImageNet).\n",
    "2. Menghilangkan lapisan klasifikasi (`model.fc = nn.Identity()`) untuk mengekstrak vektor representasi 2.048 dimensi.\n",
    "3. Menerapkan normalisasi L2 pada seluruh vektor embedding.\n",
    "4. Melakukan pencarian kemiripan citra ultra-cepat dengan **Cosine Similarity**.\n",
    "5. Menampilkan perbandingan visual Top-10 rekomendasi pakaian."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Hubungkan Google Colab, GPU, & Dependensi"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import glob\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "from PIL import Image\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "import torch.nn as nn\n",
    "from torchvision import models, transforms\n",
    "\n",
    "device = torch.device('cuda' if torch.cuda.is_available() else 'cpu')\n",
    "print(f\"Device aktif: {device}\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Inisialisasi Model ResNet-50 Pretrained ImageNet"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Memuat ResNet-50 dengan bobot standar ImageNet\n",
    "model = models.resnet50(weights=models.ResNet50_Weights.DEFAULT)\n",
    "# Mengubah layer linear terakhir menjadi Identity agar menghasilkan embedding 2048-D\n",
    "model.fc = nn.Identity()\n",
    "model = model.to(device)\n",
    "model.eval()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Pipeline transformasi citra standar\n",
    "transform_fn = transforms.Compose([\n",
    "    transforms.Resize((224, 224)),\n",
    "    transforms.ToTensor(),\n",
    "    transforms.Normalize(mean=[0.485, 0.456, 0.406], std=[0.229, 0.224, 0.225])\n",
    "])\n",
    "print(\"Model ResNet-50 siap untuk inferensi!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Ekstraksi Vektor Fitur & Normalisasi L2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "sample_dir = '../data/sample'\n",
    "sample_images = sorted(glob.glob(os.path.join(sample_dir, '*.jpg')))\n",
    "\n",
    "features_list = []\n",
    "names_list = []\n",
    "\n",
    "with torch.no_grad():\n",
    "    for path in sample_images:\n",
    "        img = Image.open(path).convert('RGB')\n",
    "        tensor = transform_fn(img).unsqueeze(0).to(device)\n",
    "        emb = model(tensor).cpu().numpy().flatten()\n",
    "        # Normalisasi L2\n",
    "        norm = np.linalg.norm(emb)\n",
    "        if norm > 0:\n",
    "            emb = emb / norm\n",
    "        features_list.append(emb)\n",
    "        names_list.append(os.path.basename(path))\n",
    "\n",
    "embeddings = np.vstack(features_list)\n",
    "print(f\"Matriks Embedding ResNet-50: {embeddings.shape} (2.048 dimensi fitur per citra)\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Pencarian Kemiripan Visual (Visual Similarity Search)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Uji coba query\n",
    "q_idx = 0\n",
    "q_feat = embeddings[q_idx]\n",
    "sim_scores = np.dot(embeddings, q_feat)\n",
    "top_k_indices = np.argsort(sim_scores)[::-1][:6]\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Gambar Query: {names_list[q_idx]}\")\n",
    "print(\"Hasil Rekomendasi ResNet-50:\")\n",
    "for r, idx in enumerate(top_k_indices, 1):\n",
    "    print(f\"{r}. {names_list[idx]} - Kemiripan: {sim_scores[idx]*100:.2f}%\")"
   ]
  }
 ],
